# Caddy reverse proxy — fronts the api container in production.
#
# SITE_ADDRESS values:
#   ":80"                → plain HTTP on the server's IP (works immediately,
#                          no domain needed — the default)
#   "yourapp.duckdns.org" → Caddy automatically provisions and renews a free
#                          Let's Encrypt certificate. HTTPS just works.
